# A method a macro of its own class names, called once besides, came out
# single-caller and clear: inlining that call and deleting it breaks the
# callback (Signup). A macro symbol of another class, which names it only
# by its name, says nothing (Helper), nor does one that only hides or
# unhooks it (Quiet).
dead app Signup#set_invite=single-caller~macro Helper#prepare=single-caller~ Quiet#hidden=single-caller~ Quiet#unhooked=single-caller~
